  "visual_review": "Inspected both newly prepared material contact sheets and the three-way block close-up from the current published Oculus 1.8.8/Beddium 1.0.11 runs. Native emission is visibly brighter than the identical alpha-zero control for the gold block, material, every tool, each held armor item and each individually worn armor piece. Tool silhouettes and dark handles remain recognizable; worn armor retains its dark openings and gold panel shapes. The block retains the largely uniform gold appearance of its original diffuse texture and visible face/edge shading. Ordinary Glowstone and both lantern controls are consistent across the pair. Matched exposure, bloom, frozen clock, exact production class hashes and all 13 alpha-only map changes authenticated; companion-on captures retain the four required range assertions."
}
